 *  resources.config
 *  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 *  AUTO-GENERATED from resources.yaml by metagear-tools/lib/build_resources_config.sh
 *  DO NOT EDIT BY HAND. Edit resources.yaml and re-run the generator.
 *
 *  Layered semantics:
 *    - `withLabel:` blocks define resource tiers consumed by `label '...'`
